4N2N5VS1pbFZ3R0V6LTdMRnF1Z0FvSktpbTNWTDR0WFh3bUdxaHJDQXNGZ1lqdmduUmV6WXpUWUtuNTRYS2U5UG9lZHBucjdQSDN5dllsOVliR0s4SlBRalM2?oc=5","date":"2026-10-09","zh":"Alphabet 和 Unity 提升遊戲開發水平"},{"title":"Why Is Unity Software Stock Gaining Thursday?","src":"Benzinga","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPMVBKdmVMdmZDVU8wc25GQVpfV1BNak5CTU9ZQVlhT3NqTVlmMTFXZDVpaGZiWnFGN3AxMExyU25TUHNPTEFNOVhfNFlGYWd0Y21scVZadjdUTTM0TjNXdTRLbGdSbkRfbzJpWUFMSVo0eVJpOGN2a2NkcmN0cVI3V2tVdDQ5aFNyRXUxQUItbHc5bUZGS0J0RGZ3UElRbjA2S0FuUXFHSjlRcmR0aTRtakgxcG44Zw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-08","zh":"為什麼 Unity Software 股票週四上漲？"}],"themes":[{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":6},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":2},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":2},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-11","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1810806/000181080626000011/unity-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Unity is the leading platform to develop, deploy, and grow games and interactive experiences. We offer a suite of tools across all major platforms from mobile, PC, and console, to extended reality (XR). Our comprehensive set of software, including AI solutions, supports developers through the entire development lifecycle – from prototyping to live service operation, user acquisition, and monetization. Our platform is used by creators of all types - such as developers, artists, and designers - to build content in gaming and non-gaming industries, including automotive, retail, manufacturing, healthcare, public sector, robotics, architecture, civil and mechanical engineering, design and construction.","zh":"Unity 是開發、部署和發展遊戲和互動體驗的領先平台。我們提供了一套跨所有主要平台的工具，從行動裝置、PC 和控制台到擴充現實 (XR)。我們的全套軟體（包括人工智慧解決方案）在整個開發生命週期中為開發人員提供支援——從原型設計到即時服務營運、用戶獲取和貨幣化。我們的平台被各種類型的創作者（例如開發人員、藝術家和設計師）用來建造遊戲和非遊戲行業的內容，包括汽車、零售、製造、醫療保健、公共部門、機器人、建築、土木和機械工程、設計和施工。"},{"en":"Our Create Solutions are a robust set of tools and services used to build, ship and run high-definition, real-time 2D and 3D content. Designed for developers, these tools and services are used across a range of industries from games to automotive, retail, manufacturing, healthcare, public sector and robotics. Create Solutions includes our custom real-time 3D engine and development environment with a high-definition render pipeline; AI-driven content creation and workflow enhancements, graphics, animation, and audio tools; navigation, networking, user interface tools and more. Enhanced by cloud services including asset management, DevOps tools and multiplayer game support, creators can leverage our products and extensibility to easily edit, run, and iterate interactive real-time 2D and 3D experiences that can be created once and deployed to a variety of platforms.","zh":"我們的創建解決方案是一套強大的工具和服務，用於建立、發布和運行高清、即時 2D 和 3D 內容。這些工具和服務專為開發人員設計，廣泛應用於遊戲、汽車、零售、製造、醫療保健、公共部門和機器人等各個行業。 Create Solutions 包括我們客製化的即時 3D 引擎和具有高清渲染管道的開發環境；人工智慧驅動的內容創建和工作流程增強、圖形、動畫和音訊工具；導航、網路、使用者介面工具等等。透過資產管理、DevOps 工具和多人遊戲支援等雲端服務的增強，創作者可以利用我們的產品和可擴展性輕鬆編輯、運行和迭代互動式即時 2D 和 3D 體驗，這些體驗只需創建一次即可部署到各種平台。"},{"en":"Our Grow Solutions primarily consist of our ads products, which offer customers the ability to grow and engage their user base and monetize their content—from 2D puzzle games to multiplayer, multi-platform games, or other 3D interactive content—irrespective of whether the content was created in Unity. Many of our customers create games and applications with the purpose of building a profitable business. This requires both the acquisition of end-users at a reasonable cost and the monetization of these end-users as they engage with the content over time. We help our customers grow their businesses in the mobile app ecosystem by offering a comprehensive suite of products designed to help customers successfully scale their businesses, including our mediation platform, ad networks (like the Unity Ad Network, powered by Unity Vector), and offerwall. In addition, Supersonic from Unity is our pu","zh":"我們的成長解決方案主要包括我們的廣告產品，這些產品使客戶能夠擴大和吸引其用戶群，並透過其內容貨幣化（從 2D 益智遊戲到多人、多平台遊戲或其他 3D 互動內容），無論內容是否是在 Unity 中創建的。我們的許多客戶創建遊戲和應用程式的目的是建立盈利業務。這需要以合理的成本獲取最終用戶，並在這些最終用戶隨著時間的推移與內容互動時將其貨幣化。我們提供一整套旨在幫助客戶成功擴展業務的產品，包括我們的中介平台、廣告網路（如由 Unity Vector 提供支援的 Unity Ad Network）和優惠牆，幫助客戶在行動應用生態系統中發展業務。另外，Unity的Supersonic是我們的PU"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Our globally diverse customers range from the largest enterprises to mid-market companies, to government and non-profit institutions, to mid-sized, small, and independent businesses and individual developers across a variety of industries.","zh":"我們的全球多元化客戶涵蓋各行業的大型企業、中端市場公司、政府和非營利組織、中型、小型和獨立企業以及個人開發商。"},{"en":"We have a very large, active, and highly engaged global community of real-time 3D (\"RT3D\") creators. The scale of our creator community provides us with a significant competitive advantage, and by incentivizing third-party platforms to strategically partner and integrate with us, we are able to further expand our community. Numerous third-party platforms partner with Unity to make it easy for our creators to deploy content seamlessly onto their platforms. These partnerships help us to maximize audience-reach for our customers and retain our platform's position as the leading hub for RT3D content creation.","zh":"我們擁有一個非常龐大、活躍且高度參與的即時 3D（「RT3D」）創作者全球社群。我們的創作者社群規模為我們提供了顯著的競爭優勢，透過激勵第三方平台與我們進行策略合作和整合，我們能夠進一步擴大我們的社群。許多第三方平台與 Unity 合作，使我們的創作者可以輕鬆地將內容無縫部署到他們的平台上。這些合作夥伴關係幫助我們最大限度地擴大客戶的受眾範圍，並保持我們平台作為 RT3D 內容創作領先中心的地位。"}],"competition":[{"en":"We primarily compete with other content development tools and monetization services. Most of these competitors offer point solutions that represent a subset of the offerings on our platform:","zh":"我們主要與其他內容開發工具和貨幣化服務競爭。大多數競爭對手提供的單點解決方案代表了我們平台上產品的一部分："},{"en":"Create Solutions: We primarily compete against proprietary game engines built in-house by large game studios, as well as Cocos2d-x (Chukong Technologies), Godot, and Unreal Engine (Epic Games), which offer game development tools primarily serving the PC games and mobile games sectors, and, in the case of Unreal Engine (Epic Games), industries beyond gaming, as well as with various social entertainment platforms. Outside of gaming, we also compete with other development platforms and software solutions that offer 2D and 3D design products.","zh":"創建解決方案：我們主要與大型遊戲工作室內部構建的專有遊戲引擎以及Cocos2d-x（觸控科技）、Godot和虛幻引擎（Epic Games）競爭，這些引擎提供的遊戲開發工具主要服務於PC遊戲和行動遊戲領域，就虛幻引擎（Epic Games）而言，服務於遊戲以外的行業以及各種社交娛樂平台。除了遊戲之外，我們還與提供 2D 和 3D 設計產品的其他開發平台和軟體解決方案競爭。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Grow Solutions","val":1228239000,"zh":"種植解決方案"},{"name":"Create Solutions","val":621409000,"zh":"創建解決方案"}],"total":1849648000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"EMEA","val":601430000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"US","val":518319000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Asia Pacific Excluding Greater China","val":349018000,"zh":"亞太地區（不含大中華區）"},{"name":"Greater China","val":333571000,"zh":"大中華區"},{"name":"Other Americas","val":47310000,"zh":"其他美洲"}],"total":1849648000}},"peers":["RBLX","SNOW","UPST","TDOC","NET"]}}